<main id="main">

<section class="fr-hero"><div class="fr-hero-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1779153249963-1c190305cff0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=1000&q=75" alt="a woman in a long coat and dress walking" width="760" height="1000" fetchpriority="high"><p class="fr-hero-cap">The long coat, walking season</p></div><div class="fr-hero-t"><p class="fr-k">Maison Frocked &middot; an outerwear journal</p><h1>A coat<br>is a <span class="fr-scr">promise</span><br>to the weather.</h1><p class="fr-lead">Frocked is an independent guide to long coats and trench coats. Learn what every strap and flap was made for, check how a coat should fit, and choose one you will wear for twenty autumns.</p>
<div class="fr-hero-a"><a class="fr-btn" href="#decode">Decode a trench</a><a class="fr-lnk" href="#fit">Check the fit</a></div><figure class="fr-hero-s"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1793395777576-100e99016686?auto=format&fit=crop&w=260&h=320&q=75" alt="a peach satin trench coat with a belt" width="260" height="320" fetchpriority="high"></figure></div></section>

<section class="fr-s fr-dc" id="decode"><div class="fr-w"><div class="fr-sh"><p class="fr-k">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">The trench coat decoder</h2><p class="fr-p">Almost every detail on a classic trench once had a job. Tap the numbered points to discover what each one was for, and what it does today.</p></div>
<div class="fr-dc-g"><div class="fr-dc-f"><div class="fr-trench"><svg viewBox="0 0 224 400" aria-hidden="true"><path class="c" d="M80 30l32 16 32-16 30 18 22 60-10 150-20 2-6-120-4 250H68L64 140l-6 120-20-2-10-150 22-60z"/><path class="l" d="M80 30l32 60 32-60M112 90v300M68 210h88M86 120l26 30 26-30"/><path class="d" d="M118 48l40 0 6 70-46 0z"/><rect class="b" x="64" y="200" width="96" height="14" rx="3"/><rect class="k" x="104" y="198" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><g class="bt"><circle cx="92" cy="140" r="4"/><circle cx="132" cy="140" r="4"/><circle cx="92" cy="170" r="4"/><circle cx="132" cy="170" r="4"/><circle cx="92" cy="240" r="4"/><circle cx="132" cy="240" r="4"/></g><path class="l" d="M30 248h22M172 248h22M60 52l30 10M164 52l-30 10"/></svg><button type="button" class="fr-hs on" style="left:29.5%;top:14.5%" data-i="0" aria-label="Epaulettes"><span>1</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:67.0%;top:24.0%" data-i="1" aria-label="Storm flap"><span>2</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:50.0%;top:10.0%" data-i="2" aria-label="Throat latch"><span>3</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:44.6%;top:37.5%" data-i="3" aria-label="Double-breasted front"><span>4</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:50.0%;top:51.5%" data-i="4" aria-label="Belt and D-rings"><span>5</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:17.9%;top:63.0%" data-i="5" aria-label="Cuff straps"><span>6</span></button><button type="button" class="fr-hs" style="left:50.0%;top:82.5%" data-i="6" aria-label="Back vent and pleat"><span>7</span></button></div></div><div class="fr-dc-r"><div class="fr-card" aria-live="polite"><p class="fr-scr" id="dc-n">no. 1</p><h3 id="dc-t"></h3><p id="dc-d"></p><div class="fr-dc-nav"><button type="button" id="dc-p" aria-label="Previous detail">&larr;</button><span id="dc-c">1 / 7</span><button type="button" id="dc-x" aria-label="Next detail">&rarr;</button></div></div><figure class="fr-dc-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1785119774727-fe76728ba491?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=300&q=75" alt="a navy military-style coat" width="520" height="300" loading="lazy"><figcaption>A military cut, softened for the street</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section>

<section class="fr-s fr-fit" id="fit"><div class="fr-w fr-fit-g"><figure class="fr-fit-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762417421173-6a9766a5b41d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=720&q=75" alt="a mannequin dressed in a tailored suit" width="520" height="720" loading="lazy"></figure><div><p class="fr-k">Tool two</p><h2 class="rv">Coat fit checker</h2><p class="fr-p">Try on a coat over the layers you will actually wear, then answer five quick questions. We tell you whether it fits, and which problems a tailor can fix.</p>
<div class="fr-q" id="ft-q"><fieldset><legend>Shoulder seams sit&hellip;</legend><div class="fr-op" data-q="0"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">At my shoulder edge</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Past my shoulder</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Inside, pulling</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Sleeves end&hellip;</legend><div class="fr-op" data-q="1"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">At the wrist bone</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Over my hand</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Above my wrist</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Buttoned over a jumper, the front&hellip;</legend><div class="fr-op" data-q="2"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Lies flat</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Is loose and boxy</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Pulls into an X</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Arms forward, the back&hellip;</legend><div class="fr-op" data-q="3"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Moves easily</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Has a lot of spare fabric</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Feels tight</button></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>The length&hellip;</legend><div class="fr-op" data-q="4"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Is what I wanted</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Feels too long</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Feels too short</button></div></fieldset></div><div class="fr-verdict" aria-live="polite"><div class="fr-dial"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="bg"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52" class="fg" id="ft-arc"/></svg><b id="ft-s">5/5</b></div><div><h3 id="ft-t">A beautiful fit</h3><ul id="ft-l" class="fr-fx"></ul></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="fr-s fr-lb"><div class="fr-w"><div class="fr-lb-h"><h2 class="rv">From the lookbook</h2><figure class="fr-wall"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1778171698295-02cc66aeefb5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=760&h=200&q=75" alt="five coats hanging on a brick wall" width="760" height="200" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="fr-lb-g"><figure class="fr-lk rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1779153249431-f740efb53c0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=600&q=75" alt="a long black coat between stone columns" width="420" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="fr-scr">1</span>Black, between columns</figcaption></figure><figure class="fr-lk rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764937572078-5e2f75649219?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=600&q=75" alt="a man wearing a long coat" width="420" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="fr-scr">2</span>His long coat</figcaption></figure><figure class="fr-lk rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762605135012-56a59a059e60?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=600&q=75" alt="a long beige coat on a staircase" width="420" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="fr-scr">3</span>Camel on the stairs</figcaption></figure><figure class="fr-lk rv"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1759852909538-57985f691821?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=600&q=75" alt="a plaid coat beside a pillar" width="420" height="600" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="fr-scr">4</span>Plaid, by the pillar</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

